sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Razorpay as Razorpay Webhook Gateway
    participant Listener as Webhook Listener Endpoint
    participant Queue as Redis Queue
    participant Worker as Background State Machine Worker

    Razorpay->>Listener: POST /api/v1/webhooks/razorpay
    Listener->>Listener: Verify HMAC-SHA256 Signature
    Listener->>Queue: Push Event to Queue
    Listener-->>Razorpay: HTTP 200 OK (Fast Ack < 5ms)
    Queue->>Worker: Consume Webhook Event
    Worker->>Worker: Execute State Machine Update & Outbox
